  "description": "Social media content creation, posting and engagement on Instagram, LinkedIn, X/Twitter, Threads, YouTube, TikTok, Reddit, dev.to, Facebook, Discord and Telegram: AI images (Nano Banana Pro, 3 options per image), AI video (Veo 3.1), carousels, per-platform posting flows, deduplication against recent posts, content strategy (hook formulas, psychological angles, content pillars), brand context, proof screenshots and daily engagement (10 thread replies per platform). Use whenever the user wants to post to social media, create social visuals, schedule posts, engage followers, grow an audience or manage any social media activity. Also activate when the user names a social platform, says 'post this', 'share on social', 'engage', 'reply to threads', 'publish a post about', 'social media blast', 'cross-post this', 'announce on social', 'spread the word', 'promote this on', 'quick post', 'post with video', 'create social content for', 'repost across socials', or references content distribution.",
